title: Top writes a foreign builder's lines into a plan, so a plan's author is not its only writer.
pid: 98efe737-c2c3-4e41-8449-a87d3e47e61b
body: |2-
  Nygard's and Oxide's records are kept by their authors. Here a
  specialist writes only its own graph, the builder of a part is often
  another specialist, and Top already writes in every graph when it absorbs their reports.
